{"actor":"Will Dower","comment":null,"created_at":"2026-02-27T08:48:35Z","event_type":"status_changed","id":2,"issue_id":"hdf-libs-9k9","new_value":"{\"status\":\"in_progress\"}","old_value":"{\"id\":\"hdf-libs-9k9\",\"title\":\"Implement trufflehog-to-hdf converter\",\"description\":\"Add TruffleHog secret detection to HDF converter. TruffleHog is a popular secret scanner used in CI/CD pipelines. Implement Go + TypeScript converters with CLI integration following the build-converter skill phases. Real fixtures available in heimdall2 sample_jsons/trufflehog_mapper/.\",\"status\":\"open\",\"priority\":2,\"issue_type\":\"feature\",\"owner\":\"will@dower.dev\",\"created_at\":\"2026-02-27T13:48:32Z\",\"created_by\":\"Will Dower\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-02-27T13:48:32Z\"}"}
